{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09025","headline":"沣上西斋寄诸友 · 韦应物","name":"沣上西斋寄诸友","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"绝岸临西野，旷然尘事遥。\n清川下逦迤，茅栋上迢嶢。\n翫月爱佳夕，望山属清朝。\n俯砌视归翼，开襟纳远飙。\n等陶辞小秩，效朱方负樵。\n闲游忽无累，心迹随景超。\n明世重才彦，雨露降丹霄。\n羣公正云集，独予忻寂寥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09025.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09025","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}